Output docs/assets/07-lsp-completion.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1000
Set Height 560
Set TypingSpeed 35ms
Set Theme "Catppuccin Frappe"

Type "nvim -u docs/vhs/demo-init.lua docs/vhs/demo/chapters/02_the_crossing.md"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Type "Go"
Sleep 1s
Type "The Gr"
Sleep 1s
Ctrl+X Ctrl+O
Sleep 2s
Ctrl+N
Sleep 1s
Ctrl+Y
Sleep 1s
Type ":qa!"
Enter